Error [jet.ImpureGateNotAllowed]: `greeting()` inside `#Impure` is a Tier-2 comptime effect, but `--gate impure=allow` was not passed
  --> tests/ui/impure_helper_read_needs_the_gate.jet:16:13
    |
 16 |             greeting("greeting.txt")
    |             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The `#Impure` block opts in to ambient I/O, but the invocation gate is also required so CI can audit builds that touch the host.
 Fix: Add `--gate impure=allow` to your `jet build` / `jet run` invocation.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3411
